                <p class="lead">Every meaningful organization begins with a sincere intention. For ASFI, that intention was to revive the spirit of Sadaqah through an organized, sustainable, and meaningful system of mutual care.</p>
                <p>The journey began in early 2024 under the name <strong>AMIS Family</strong>. Individuals were encouraged to contribute any amount of voluntary monthly Sadaqah, with consistency and compassion valued above the size of the contribution.</p>
                <p>Its first flagship initiative, the <strong>SMILE Program</strong>, provided selected economically disadvantaged mothers with livelihood capital so they could build small businesses while remaining at home to care for their children. Islamic seminars and written assessments supported their spiritual and personal development.</p>
