                <p>As the programs reached more families, the need for a formal and sustainable structure became clear. The organization adopted the name <strong>AMIS Sadaqah Family Incorporated</strong> and became a SEC-registered, non-stock, non-profit corporation guided by Islamic values of compassion, Sadaqah, and community service.</p>
